 ](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/42895801)\n**This ride is intended for th
 e experienced group rider in good physical condition and capable of mainta
 ining a steady pace. Few stops if any. Riders unable to maintain the pace 
 may be dropped. If unsure if this ride is for you\, it is recommended you 
 try the "A" ride option first.**\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Ple
 ase bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO
 2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we re
 quire an LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nB
 eing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://ww
 w.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour R
