SUMMARY:Challenging Ride (A) - CV CVHS To Strasburg (36R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nAnticipated average pace:
  **18-20 mph**\n\nCue: [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-cvhs-t
 o-strasburg-36r/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-cvhs-to-stra
 sburg-36r/)\n\n**This is a Challenging (A) level ride and intended to be a
  NO DROP RIDE.** The ride leader will ride at the advertised average speed
  and will do his/her best to keep the group together with regroupings and 
 a sweeper may also be appointed at the start. **Please do not join this ri
 de if you are not willing to stick with the group.** If maintaining an 18-
 20mph average is beyond your current ability level\, please consider joini
 ng an "Advanced" ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please 
 bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 in
 flator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we requir
 e an LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing
  on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.la
 ncasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP 
 is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbik
 eclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323
 984)\,\n\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content
 .aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](http
 s://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3144630
 13/
