SUMMARY:FUN RIDE-WH SUNDAE EVENING SOCIAL (19F-ish)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nLeader: John Cardos\nSwee
 p: Volunteer to Sweep\n\nWe will regroup often as needed so no one is left
  behind. I am doing an easy modification toward the end of the ride to byp
 ass the worst climb. The rest are easy for the most part (you've been prac
 ticing for 3 weeks already)\n\nHelmets are Mandatory. No earbuds. Bring wa
 ter and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).
 \n\nWe require [LBC Membership](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.
 aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148) and Meetup RSVP to join this ride. Being a
  Meetup member does not make you a Club Member. An LBC member may register
  you as a guest. we invite you to join the Club. Your RSVP is your agreeme
 nt to abide by the Club [CODE OF CONDUCT](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.ne
 t/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\, [RULES OF THE
  ROAD](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=2
 57148&module_id=325159)\, & WAIVER OF LIABILITY. These and\; CUE Sheet\, G
 PX Files\, and joining information are at: www.lancasterbikeclub.org
